= Arthur Crispien

Crispien is [? if chancellor = "Crispien": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Crispien": the current President and ?] a former leader of the USPD who was expelled over his opposition to the merger between the USPD and USPD.

- @left_unity
- @uspd_cooperation
